     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\"><b>Interactive introductory distance sampling training</b></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The University of St Andrews has been training ecologists and statisticians in design and analysis of distance sampling studies for decades. Distance sampling methods are widely used in population assessment of many different taxonomic\r\n groups. Perhaps you&#39;ve wanted to attend a previous workshop, but schedules conflicted with your field work. 👨‍🌾</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>We are offering the training workshop in 10 2.5-hour blocks in October 2023.  You will be invited to interact in short lectures on distance sampling principles. 👩‍🎓 Exercises analysing data sets in R will reinforce those principles\r\n and the lecturer will be available to assist during the practical session via screen sharing.  The session will conclude with a summary of the exercise and question/answer session for both lecture and exercise. 💻  You can participate in polls during the workshop\r\n to assess your comprehension of topics discussed. 🤔 In addition to questions at any time during the lectures and practicals, an optional additional half hour will be set aside each session for discussion of topics arising. 🗣</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The workshop will be delivered using Zoom web conferencing software along with R-Studio &quot;in the cloud&quot;.☁️ You will need (free) accounts for both pieces of software. I encourage you to experiment with Zoom (at\r\n<a href=\"https://zoom.us\" title=\"https://zoom.us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0VFp966E5soM-dutYHjxn8\">\r\nhttps://zoom.us</a>) and <a href=\"https://posit.cloud\" title=\"https://posit.cloud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0VWBuk1YmoJ8Sz31Ka98aV\">\r\nhttps://posit.cloud</a> before the workshop begins. 👩‍💻  There will be an internet\r\n<i>connection testing and general orientation session</i> the week of 29 Sept - 03 Oct 2023.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\" style=\"border-spacing:0px\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:66.8571px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://posit.cloud/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2P9fQP0AQjYz5Q-2ACr7WW\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"66\" width=\"240\" style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/1-WZLz5eUgbFPRPB1TWSOr08uPIWYR5TDm-ptqST_Fkhg1FfC7pDtzEPZJHlMR47WdI4W8gV6TZ17ijiXQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://posit.cloud/images/posit-cloud.jpg\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://posit.cloud/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://posit.cloud/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2P9fQP0AQjYz5Q-2ACr7WW\">Posit Cloud - Do, share, teach, and learn data science</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(166,166,166)\">\r\nposit.cloud</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\" style=\"border-spacing:0px\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:126px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://zoom.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aG6I8UKM_vz6xkcr2sS_p\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"126\" width=\"240\" style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/SSqldXGmIK_q05UgmyW_8nvzZ2ef4ajyXVXoOkiLd_yuNJWxNEMsqoi1RWT4uNFlhVZEbNxj__pW3QP4eganRrD2NFKW9-A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://st3.zoom.us/static/6.3.14617/image/thumb.png\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://zoom.us/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zoom.us/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aG6I8UKM_vz6xkcr2sS_p\">One platform to connect | Zoom</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">\r\nModernize workflows with Zoom&#39;s trusted collaboration tools: including video meetings, team chat, VoIP phone, webinars, whiteboard, contact center, and events.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(166,166,166)\">\r\n<a href=\"http://zoom.us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zoom.us&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PiY7xuUggxhsF5-NwsqEk\">zoom.us</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Important details</span></b></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Workshop dates and time:  <b>09-20 October 2023; 1400-1630 British Summer Time</b>.\r\n</li><ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\r\n<li>For the time of day in your time zone, consult\r\n<a href=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+training+workshop&amp;iso=20231009T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30\" title=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+training+workshop&amp;iso=20231009T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg%3DIntroductory%2Bdistance%2Bsampling%2Btraining%2Bworkshop%26iso%3D20231009T14%26p1%3D3853%26ah%3D2%26am%3D30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sUEJMlWZeTZyt5_ytRt3p\">\r\nhttps://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+training+workshop&amp;iso=20231009T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30</a>🕰️</li><div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"top\" style=\"border-spacing:0px\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:126px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+training+workshop&amp;iso=20231009T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg%3DIntroductory%2Bdistance%2Bsampling%2Btraining%2Bworkshop%26iso%3D20231009T14%26p1%3D3853%26ah%3D2%26am%3D30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052637000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sUEJMlWZeTZyt5_ytRt3p\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"126\" width=\"240\" style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/qVuJzGPtKp5WFjUAjF5m5EEtGPEVBV1B2hOTlUKuuuZQ9T-z_Uy-p4CXvlAG3tk1b6W7F6LtTB2zlBqdQzAlcf_hZErF0cfGjN9oGJ2UH5_0bmIBGyF-BZmyQuBkRvW14rBiUwwyyEa6X9GWSTPLs9CNbKB632WepwmPETk65Bw=s0-d-e1-ft#https://www.timeanddate.com/scripts/worldclock_og.php?h1=World%20Clock&amp;h2=Local%20Time%20Around%20the%20World\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Introductory+distance+sampling+training+workshop&amp;iso=20231009T14&amp;p1=3853&amp;ah=2&amp;am=30\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg%3DIntroductory%2Bdistance%2Bsampling%2Btraining%2Bworkshop%26iso%3D20231009T14%26p1%3D3853%26ah%3D2%26am%3D30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ic47ZIAa3EnQVEvOuzolq\">Event\r\n Time Announcer</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">\r\nEvent Time Announcer shows time for an event in locations all over the world. In St Andrews it happens on Monday, October 9, 2023 at 2:00:00 pm.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(166,166,166)\">\r\n<a href=\"http://www.timeanddate.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.timeanddate.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EEIlE80fjjFVtzgOXIUcN\">www.timeanddate.com</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type:disc;color:rgb(200,38,19)\">\r\nRegistration deadline:<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><b> 22 Sept 2023</b></span>📅</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Enrolment limit: 14</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Cost: 225 British pounds 💵</li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">What is included: Lectures, exercises, code, data all available online📃</li></ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\"><b>Widening participation scholarship</b></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>One place will have the registration fee waived, for participants from under-represented groups.  Details of eligibility and application process at\r\n<a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation\" title=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25lPXVIaDV1t_7p3ZivEsR\">\r\nhttp://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation</a>. Deadline for scholarship application for the October 2023 introductory workshop is\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><b>21 August 2023</b></span>.    </div>\r\n<div><b><br>\r\n</b></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\"><b>What they are saying</b></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I would like to say I really liked RStudio Cloud and it is working just fine and I am really enjoying using it as a student. I&#39;m looking forward to using it as an instructor too. I really liked the first half of the course. I love\r\n distance sampling and I am enjoying every second of the course! The only thing I can say about this particular workshop is it deserves more time. -- Kaan Özgencil, PhD student, Department of Biological Sciences, Middle East Technical University, Ankara</div>\r\n<div><b><br>\r\n</b></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\"><b>Further details</b></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-oct-2023.htm\" title=\"http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-oct-2023.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-oct-2023.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Gz_tnCUh_F0J5HaRULGtv\">http://workshops.distancesampling.org/intro-oct-2023.htm</a>l</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>At the webpage above, you will find a link to the St Andrews online shop where payment is made. Registration is now open--14 August 2023.  After you registration, I will contact you with additional details regarding workshop electronic\r\n materials, etc. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Feel free to contact me with questions. Please share this announcement with interested colleagues 🏢.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Information regarding all distance sampling workshops can be found at</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://workshops.distancesampling.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://workshops.distancesampling.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472052638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bTaPWESBpqkQ4vBOksAs7\">https://workshops.distancesampling.org</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\nEric Rexstad</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Centre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\nUniversity of St Andrews</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Registered Charity in Scotland SC013532</span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
